; The USB4 software connection manager's NHIs (Phase 40): until it lands
; the driver starts on them and does nothing (AMD's from FreeBSD's
; nhi_reg.h). Untested. The class line
; takes any USB4 NHI (class 0C/03/40); whether Windows 98's engine
; matches a PCI\CC_ id is unread.
%Usb4Desc%=Cm.Dev6,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_A833
%Usb4Desc%=Cm.Dev6,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_A834
%Usb4Desc%=Cm.Dev6,PCI\VEN_8086&DEV_E333
